  title: 'How to Avoid Extra Baggage Fees When Flying',
  excerpt: 'Baggage fees can turn a cheap flight into an expensive one. Learn how to pack smarter, understand airline baggage rules, choose the right fare, and avoid unnecessary charges before you reach the airport.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
