  title: 'Budget Travel Mistakes That Can Cost You More',
  excerpt: 'Trying to save money on travel can sometimes have the opposite effect. Learn the most common budget travel mistakes and how to avoid hidden costs while planning a cheaper trip.',
  category: 'Budget Travel',
  readTime: '5 min read',
  publishedDate: 'August 20, 2026',
