  title: 'Should You Prepay for Fuel When Renting a Car?',
  excerpt: 'Prepaid fuel can make returning a rental car easier, but it is not always the cheapest option. Learn how prepaid fuel works and when it makes sense for your trip.',
  category: 'Car Rental',
