  title: 'What to Know Before Renting a Car in Europe',
  excerpt: 'Planning a European road trip? Learn what to check before renting a car, including driving requirements, insurance, tolls, parking, fuel, border crossings, and rental rules.',
  category: 'Car Rental',
  readTime: '5 min read',
  publishedDate: 'August 22, 2026',
