  title: 'One-Way Car Rental: When Does It Make Sense?',
  excerpt: 'A one-way rental can make a road trip much easier when you do not want to return to your starting point. Learn when the extra cost is worth paying and what to check before booking.',
  category: 'Car Rental',
  readTime: '5 min read',
  publishedDate: 'August 22, 2026',
